=== parameters ===
panel 200 assets x 750 days; 10 industries
DGP: r = beta_true*f_true + beta_mkt*f_mkt + beta_size*f_size + industry + noise
MU_STRONG=0.0025 (INFLATED teaching setting)  MU_WEAK=0.001 (realistic-weak foil, target RankIC ~0.02-0.05)
raw_factor = beta_true + 0.4*industry + 0.25*size_loading + noise
look-ahead: factor[t] vs fwd from t+1; LS weights shift(1); impact vol lagged; neutralize uses log_mcap.shift(1)
cite: Fama & MacBeth 1973 JPE 81(3) 607-636
cite: Fama & French 1993 JFE 33(1) 3-56 — FF3; 2015 JFE 116(1) 1-22 — FF5
cite: Harvey, Liu & Zhu 2016 RFS 29(1) 5-68 — t>3 multiple-testing hurdle
cite: Alphalens Reloaded docs (alphalens.ml4trading.io); Qlib CSZScoreNorm / Alpha158
niche: quant-wiki foil; frontier LLM mining deferred to P8
note: overlapping multi-day IC windows mainly inflate IC autocorrelation and ICIR SE (not mean IC);
      fix with non-overlapping sampling or Newey–West on the IC series

