=== strong vs weak panel (side-by-side) ===
STRONG panel is an INFLATED teaching setting so FM/t>3 recover cleanly;
WEAK panel (MU_WEAK) targets RankIC ~0.02-0.05 — closer to live single-factor magnitudes.
strong MU=0.0025 RankIC=0.1119 ICIR=4.636 gross_SR=4.495 net_SR=3.668 turn=1.0586
weak   MU=0.0010 RankIC=0.0431 ICIR=1.769 gross_SR=1.619 net_SR=0.792 turn=1.0586
teach: real single factors are WEAK; costs can wipe net SR even when gross>0; combining many weak signals is why multi-factor exists
